Excuse me, Hef, I got a plane to land.

19:57.209 --> 20:00.644
- We are all gonna die!
- I can't believe this is happening.

20:04.481 --> 20:07.075
<i>Help us!
Help!</i>

20:07.184 --> 20:09.880
Men, we're doing everything
in our power to get you down.

20:10.321 --> 20:12.948
Stand aside, sir. I'll take it from here.

20:13.056 --> 20:14.387
Peter, this is Quagmire.

20:14.490 --> 20:17.391
Now, I want you to listen very carefully
and do exactly as I tell you.

20:17.493 --> 20:21.896
Take a firm hold of the throttle and pull
the red mixture knob out slowly.

20:21.998 --> 20:22.965
<i>Okay.</i>

20:23.066 --> 20:25.533
All right, now do you see a button
that looks like a drunken gay guy

20:25.634 --> 20:26.862
eyeing you from across the bar?

20:30.072 --> 20:32.336
<i>- Yeah, I see it.
- All right, press the button right above it.</i>

20:32.941 --> 20:35.307
Some new developments
in the Flight 209 drama.

20:35.477 --> 20:38.206
Recently discharged pilot
Captain Glenn Quagmire

20:38.312 --> 20:40.143
is apparently talking the plane down.

20:40.248 --> 20:42.045
Ollie Williams has the story. Ollie?

20:42.149 --> 20:43.309
I'm at the wrong airport.

20:43.417 --> 20:44.611
Well, thanks Ollie.

20:44.719 --> 20:47.779
Coming up, why calling every Asian man
you meet "Chung King"

20:47.888 --> 20:50.583
can land an anchorman in hot water.
After this.

20:55.562 --> 20:58.053
<i>All right, Peter, slide the red knob
all the way out.</i>

20:58.198 --> 21:01.394
<i>And the second those wheels touch
the ground, you hit the emergency brake.</i>

21:18.616 --> 21:20.743
- We made it!
- Hallelujah!

21:20.852 --> 21:21.978
Get some!

21:22.086 --> 21:25.646
<i>Well, guess there's nothing left to do
but watch the end of Last Holiday.</i>

21:32.129 --> 21:33.255
<i>Damn!</i>

21:34.998 --> 21:38.558
- Oh, no, she didn't.
- Oh, yes, she did.

21:38.668 --> 21:41.432
- No, she didn't.
- Yes, she did.

21:41.537 --> 21:44.700
- No, she didn't.
- Yes, she did, Peter! I just saw it!

21:44.807 --> 21:46.001
All right, take it easy.

21:51.079 --> 21:53.343
Glenn, we are so thrilled for you.

21:53.448 --> 21:55.643
Yeah, I guess it didn't take too much
for you to get your job back,

21:55.750 --> 21:56.808
now that you're a hero.

21:56.918 --> 21:58.112
Yeah, and I'm so happy for you,

21:58.219 --> 22:00.414
I don't even mind that I was raped
in a federal prison

22:00.522 --> 22:02.182
after I was arrested for hijacking.

22:02.289 --> 22:04.280
Well, I couldn't have done it
without you guys.

22:04.391 --> 22:07.792
You put yourselves on the line
and you gave me my life back.

22:07.895 --> 22:09.385
I'll never forget that.

22:09.496 --> 22:12.331
Now if you'll excuse me,
I got to go to work.

22:12.332 --> 23:13.332
Thank you for watching «Family Guy» on
www.FOX-fan.ru